      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should probably call them but they are closed until monday and the pain is really getting to me. i dont want to wait days if i can just handle it now. what is the usual dose for macrobid for an adult? i just want to know if it's even a huge deal or if i can just take one or two to see if it helps until i can talk to my doctor.",
