    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get it about the resistance thing but i'm just in so much pain and i don't want to go to the er if i don't have to. if i can't do the macrobid, can i just take a bunch of vitamin c or something like cranberry extract instead? i've heard that can clear up infections pretty fast without the side effects of drugs. would a high dose of vitamin c be safe enough to try for now?",
